    prompt: "Malini's picture chart of buttermilk glasses at a wedding uses 1 symbol for 10 glasses: 3 symbols in the first hour, 2\u00bd in the second and 4 in the third. If she draws it again using 1 symbol for 5 glasses, how many symbols will she draw altogether?",
